tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-233-a-librarys-route-names-the-compilers-own-flag.hero:10:23: error[machine_locked_path]: `C:/side/lp188` names a path, and a library in a group head says what the machine has, not where this machine keeps it — the next machine keeps it elsewhere
